# Build outputs
# Adapted from symaira-browse's .gitignore for this receiving copy: entries
# for directories not carried over by the source intake (fuzz/, dist/ via
# .goreleaser.yml, testdata/) are dropped; entries for what was carried are
# kept. See browse/SOURCE_PROVENANCE.md.
/symbrowse
/target/
/port/results/
**/__pycache__/

# macOS
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Go
*.test
*.out
vendor/

# Config / secrets
.env
*.local

# Cache
.cache/

# Local audit reports
.github/audit/

# Documentation builds / local notes (published docs/*.md stay tracked)
docs/_build/
docs/.vitepress/cache/
docs/adopt/

# Local agent reports / session state
.github/coverage/
.github/prerelease/
.github/review/
.omo/
.omo/run-continuation/
.omo/notepads/
coverage.html

# Local agent worktrees
.worktrees/

# --- Symaira internal working artifacts (never published; see root AGENTS.md) ---
.github/app-test/
.github/admin/
.github/branch-protection/
**/docs/adopt/
**/docs/teardown/
**/docs/planned/
**/docs/intern/
**/docs/roadmap.md
PLANUNG.md
ARCHITEKTUR.md
.claude/
